    `[pi-model-router] registry guard FAILED: no closure capture and no ` +
      `module fallback (pid=${diagnostic.pid}, uptimeMs=${diagnostic.uptimeMs}, ` +
      `argvFlags=${diagnostic.argvFlags}, ${diagnostic.detail})`,
  );
